conjugate, then the nonnegative-LU adapter proves the source
`|L||U| = |A|` conclusion for `A`. -/
theorem higham9_8_abs_lu_product_eq_abs_of_checkerboard_principalBlock_inequalities
    {n : ℕ} (A : Fin n → Fin n → ℝ)
